{
  "tema": 5251,
  "slug": "puse-puso",
  "titulo": "Poner in the preterite",
  "subtitulo": "Puse la tabla en el carro.",
  "foto": "t10.jpg",
  "regla": "Poner is irregular in the preterite: stem pus- with unaccented endings: puse, pusiste, puso, pusimos, pusieron. Its derivatives (proponer, suponer, componer…) and ponerse follow it.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": null,
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "In the preterite, **poner** changes its stem to **pus-**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "pus-",
            "+",
            "-e, -iste, -o, -imos, -ieron"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "Person",
            "poner"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "yo",
              "puse"
            ],
            [
              "tú",
              "pusiste"
            ],
            [
              "él / ella / usted",
              "puso"
            ],
            [
              "nosotros / nosotras",
              "pusimos"
            ],
            [
              "ellos / ellas / ustedes",
              "pusieron"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**No written accents**: **puse**, **puso**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Verbs built on poner do the same: **proponer → propuse**, **suponer → supuso**, **componer → compuso**, **imponer → impuso**, **exponer → expusieron**."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Ponerse** + adjective = _to become, get_ (a mood or state): **Me puse nervioso.** **Ponerse** + clothing = _to put on_: **Se puso la sudadera.**"
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **puse** (**s**, _set it_) is from **poner**; **pude** (**d**, _did it_) is from **poder**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
